Subject: [PATCH] feat(intro): golden-thread phase choreography with an
 explicit invitation
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The intro auto-dismissed on a timer after a single abstract sketch. It now runs a
deterministic THREAD -> MASK -> SCALES -> LOGO -> INVITATION sequence, reveals the
approved logo master, and waits for the visitor with a bilingual
"Enter Basma's Universe" / "ادخل عالم بسمة" button.

- src/lib/experience/intro-sequence.js: the phase machine (plain JS, unit tested)
- src/components/brand/GoldenThreadSplash.jsx: mask and justice-scales thread
  drawing, logo reveal, focus trap, scroll lock, Escape/skip, reduced-motion
  opens on the static invitation, session replay keeps its public API
- tests/intro-sequence.test.mjs: chain order, timers, gating

Ported from the Next.js Basma app's splash machine; no Next.js APIs, no new
dependencies (framer-motion and Tailwind were already here).
